# Type and page chrome

Primitives live in `app/globals.css` `:root`. Do not invent `text-[0.xxrem]` or `tracking-[0.xxem]`.

| Token | Value | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `--text-micro` | `0.5rem` | Dense UI (orbit, tiny meta) |
| `--text-label` | `0.75rem` | Kickers, nav, buttons, mono labels |
| `--text-body` | `1rem` | Body copy |
| `--tracking-kicker` | `0.3em` | `.kicker` and the header mark |
| `--tracking-label` | `0.2em` | Other uppercase mono |
| `--tracking-display` | `-0.05em` | Headings |

Classes: `.kicker`, `.label-meta`, `.page-gutter`, `.page-offset`. Headings: `SectionHeading` (`h1`/`h2` + hairline). Hero name may use `clamp(3rem, 9vw, 5.5rem)`.

```tsx
// BAD
<p className="font-mono text-[0.68rem] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase">

// GOOD
<p className="label-meta text-star-bright">
```

Tailwind: `text-label`, `text-body`, `tracking-display`. Breakpoints in custom CSS: `640` / `768` / `1024` / `1280` (plus `1536` only for the 6-col orbit).
